#: ../../foundations.rst:83
#: dadf207e619346e99ae8559e5fde5c13
msgid "The Diátaxis map of documentation is a memorable and approachable idea. But, a map is only reliable if it adequately describes a reality. Diátaxis is underpinned by a systematic description and analysis of generalised **user needs**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../foundations.rst:85
#: 99020fd6033b4985a28fa778ea52b8a0
msgid "This is why the tutorials, how-to guides, reference and explanation of Diátaxis are a complete enumeration of the types of documentation that serve practitioners in a craft. This is why there are four and only four types of documentation. There is simply no other territory to cover."
msgstr ""
